{"pages":[{"h":792,"w":612,"ocr":false,"segs":[["CREATING A GOOD FUNDRAISING OFFER 1",43.841199999999994,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,679.63630000000001,9,false],["CREATING A GOOD",150.90000000000001,33.840599999999995,472.18000000000006,116.00059999999996,80,false],["FUNDRAISING OFFER",150.90000000000001,93.840599999999995,520.0200000000001,176.00059999999996,80,false],["U.S. CAMPUS MINISTRY",150.90000000000001,167.78059999999994,357.25999999999999,194.10059999999999,20,false],["WHAT IS A GOOD OFFER?",146.40000000000001,227.5951,226.36500000000001,243.00009999999997,15,false],["It’s a statement that conveys the specific service,",146.40000000000001,243.11509999999987,328.12800000000004,255.51709999999991,9,false],["benefit or action that will be achieved for a specific",146.40000000000001,256.11509999999987,335.79600000000005,268.51709999999991,9,false],["dollar given. In other words, for a gift of $X, we will be",146.40000000000001,269.11509999999998,346.40699999999993,281.51709999999997,9,false],["able to do Y. It looks something like this:",146.40000000000001,282.11509999999998,295.78200000000004,294.51709999999997,9,false],["gift can be incorporated as part of the offer, it’s",388.20000000000005,225.43489999999986,560.97300000000007,237.8368999999999,9,false],["even more effective.",388.20000000000005,238.43489999999986,463.32300000000009,250.8368999999999,9,false],["Donor Contribution + Organizational Ministry =",146.40000000000001,308.11509999999998,327.79500000000002,320.51709999999997,9,false],["Beneficiary Helped",146.40000000000001,321.11509999999998,218.81400000000002,333.51709999999997,9,false],["QUESTIONS TO HELP DEVELOP THE OFFER",370.20000000000005,274.91489999999999,508.03500000000008,290.31989999999996,15,false],["• What’s the problem or opportunity?",370.20000000000005,290.43489999999997,524.20800000000008,302.83689999999996,9,false],["• How are we going to solve it?",370.20000000000005,303.43489999999997,497.15400000000011,315.83689999999996,9,false],["• What are the consequences of not acting?",370.20000000000005,316.43489999999997,545.96100000000001,328.83689999999996,9,false],["• How can you be involved?",370.20000000000005,329.43489999999997,485.88600000000008,341.83689999999996,9,false],["The “offer” is one of the most important elements in",146.40000000000001,347.11509999999998,340.827,359.51709999999997,9,false],["any fund development strategy.",146.40000000000001,360.11509999999998,263.553,372.51709999999997,9,false],["WHAT MAKES A GOOD OFFER?",146.40000000000001,396.5951,243.28500000000003,412.00009999999997,15,false],["There are several factors that contribute to a well-",146.40000000000001,412.11509999999998,333.80700000000002,424.51709999999997,9,false],["developed offer:",146.40000000000001,425.11509999999998,206.16000000000003,437.51709999999997,9,false],["• It meets a basic human need – Jesus told us to",146.40000000000001,438.11509999999998,336.21900000000005,450.51709999999997,9,false],["give (food,",164.40000000000001,451.11509999999998,203.27100000000002,463.51709999999997,9,false],["• clothing, water, housing, medical care, the gospel).",146.40000000000001,464.11509999999998,351.88799999999998,476.51709999999997,9,false],["• It’s related directly to the primary mission of the",146.40000000000001,477.11509999999998,345.471,489.51709999999997,9,false],["• organization.",146.40000000000001,490.11509999999998,214.32300000000001,502.51709999999997,9,false],["• It’s simple and specific – you can picture it in",146.40000000000001,503.11509999999998,332.07000000000005,515.51710000000003,9,false],["your mind. The more explaining you have to do to",164.40000000000001,516.11509999999998,348.56699999999995,528.51710000000003,9,false],["present the offer, the less effective it will be.",164.40000000000001,529.11509999999998,327.33600000000001,541.51710000000003,9,false],["• It has a clear and quantifiable value exchange so",146.40000000000001,542.11509999999998,343.36500000000001,554.51710000000003,9,false],["the donor knows what their gift will accomplish.",164.40000000000001,555.11509999999998,345.30900000000008,567.51710000000003,9,false],["• It’s believable – something you can prove works",146.40000000000001,568.11509999999998,342.33000000000004,580.51710000000003,9,false],["to meet the immediate need and have a lasting",164.40000000000001,581.11509999999998,336.97500000000002,593.51710000000003,9,false],["impact (perhaps solving a problem permanently).",164.40000000000001,594.11509999999998,349.73700000000008,606.51710000000003,9,false],["• It has urgency – there’s a limited window of",146.40000000000001,607.11509999999998,326.86799999999994,619.51710000000003,9,false],["opportunity (time) to meet the need.",164.40000000000001,620.11509999999998,300.88499999999999,632.51710000000003,9,false],["• It states how it will make the beneficiary’s life",146.40000000000001,633.11509999999998,335.46299999999997,645.51710000000003,9,false],["better – it’s deserving",164.40000000000001,646.11509999999998,244.83299999999997,658.51710000000003,9,false],["• It’s something the donor has responded to in the",146.40000000000001,659.11509999999998,344.30999999999995,671.51710000000003,9,false],["past or would want to give to – something that",164.40000000000001,672.11509999999998,336.13800000000003,684.51710000000003,9,false],["makes the donor feel good about giving.",164.40000000000001,685.11509999999998,311.63999999999999,697.51710000000003,9,false],["• It’s a good bargain or investment. If a matching",146.40000000000001,698.11509999999998,339.423,710.51710000000003,9,false],["HOW TO DEVELOP A GOOD OFFER",370.20000000000005,365.91489999999999,478.69500000000005,381.31989999999996,15,false],["1. Provide a clear statement of the “offer.”",370.20000000000005,381.43489999999997,525.53099999999995,393.83689999999996,9,false],["• Identify the need.",370.20000000000005,394.43489999999997,455.08800000000008,406.83689999999996,9,false],["• Acknowledge the donor’s care and concern for",370.20000000000005,407.43489999999997,563.21400000000017,419.83689999999996,9,false],["the need.",388.20000000000005,420.43489999999997,422.66100000000006,432.83689999999996,9,false],["• Point out how your ministry will address the",370.20000000000005,433.43489999999997,556.47300000000018,445.83689999999996,9,false],["need...with the help of “people like you” (donor).",388.20000000000005,446.43489999999997,569.24400000000014,458.83689999999996,9,false],["• Bottom line: If you give X, Y will happen.",370.20000000000005,459.43489999999997,540.8130000000001,471.83689999999996,9,false],["2. Speak to the interests of your audience — not your",370.20000000000005,485.43490000000003,567.95700000000011,497.83690000000001,9,false],["board, your staff, or yourself. Ask yourself these",370.20000000000005,498.43490000000003,549.4620000000001,510.83690000000001,9,false],["questions:",370.20000000000005,511.43490000000003,409.46700000000004,523.83690000000001,9,false],["• What motivates your donor?",370.20000000000005,524.43489999999997,496.524,536.83690000000001,9,false],["• What touches their heart, not just their head?",370.20000000000005,537.43489999999997,560.5680000000001,549.83690000000001,9,false],["• What are they sympathetic to? What makes them",370.20000000000005,550.43489999999997,574.59000000000003,562.83690000000001,9,false],["unsympathetic?",388.20000000000005,563.43489999999997,449.58000000000004,575.83690000000001,9,false],["• Why do they give now?",370.20000000000005,576.43489999999997,474.96900000000005,588.83690000000001,9,false],["• What would they view as a good reason to give",370.20000000000005,589.43489999999997,562.42200000000014,601.83690000000001,9,false],["tomorrow?",388.20000000000005,602.43489999999997,430.61700000000008,614.83690000000001,9,false],["• What are the consequences if the need isn’t met?",370.20000000000005,615.43489999999997,572.82600000000014,627.83690000000001,9,false],["3. Support your ask with valuable, pertinent facts and",370.20000000000005,641.43489999999997,571.98000000000025,653.83690000000001,9,false],["figures.",370.20000000000005,654.43489999999997,398.09100000000007,666.83690000000001,9,false],["4. Make your ask and build your case using a personal",370.20000000000005,680.43489999999997,571.85400000000016,692.83690000000001,9,false],["approach.",370.20000000000005,693.43489999999997,407.96400000000006,705.83690000000001,9,false]]},{"segs":[["CREATING A GOOD FUNDRAISING OFFER 2",43.841199999999994,509.49990000000003,57.071200000000005,680.42830000000004,9,false],["5. Identify tangible “dollar handles” — specific gift",146.40000000000001,33.434899999999857,334.9860000000001,45.836899999999901,9,false],["amounts and what they will accomplish.",146.40000000000001,46.434899999999857,298.81500000000005,58.836899999999901,9,false],["• Instead of “Would you consider a gift of X, Y or",146.40000000000001,59.434899999999857,340.41300000000012,71.836899999999901,9,false],["Z?”",164.40000000000001,72.434899999999857,177.43200000000002,84.836899999999901,9,false],["• Your gift of A will bring about B, 2A will bring",146.40000000000001,85.434899999999857,335.83200000000005,97.836899999999901,9,false],["about 2B, etc.",164.40000000000001,98.434899999999857,215.46600000000001,110.8368999999999,9,false],["General rules of thumb for good resources to",146.40000000000001,124.10189999999989,333.77999999999997,137.48489999999993,9,false],["support your Offer:",146.40000000000001,137.10189999999989,227.48099999999999,150.48489999999993,9,false],["• Photos — personal, emotional, “real”",146.40000000000001,150.43489999999986,302.37900000000002,162.8368999999999,9,false],["• Stories — human angle, depth of need, a call to",146.40000000000001,163.43489999999986,338.60400000000016,175.8368999999999,9,false],["action",164.40000000000001,176.43489999999986,188.565,188.8368999999999,9,false],["• Statistics — pertinent, insightful, startling,",146.40000000000001,189.43489999999986,326.39100000000002,201.8368999999999,9,false],["telling",164.40000000000001,202.43489999999986,188.952,214.8368999999999,9,false],["• Organization’s response — program benefits, new",146.40000000000001,215.43489999999986,350.94300000000004,227.8368999999999,9,false],["goals, most urgent need, actual costs",164.40000000000001,228.43489999999986,302.10000000000002,240.8368999999999,9,false],["• Dollar handles — tangible, accomplish a lot with",146.40000000000001,241.43489999999986,346.11000000000007,253.8368999999999,9,false],["little",164.40000000000001,254.43489999999986,182.70600000000002,266.8368999999999,9,false],["• Never forget: The better the resource, the more",146.40000000000001,267.43489999999986,342.34800000000007,279.8368999999999,9,false],["compelling your appeal!",164.40000000000001,280.43489999999997,255.46200000000002,292.83689999999996,9,false]],"h":792,"w":612,"ocr":false}]}